{"questions":[{"id":"Q072-V2","typeId":"鄰邊平均環","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"variantOf":"Q072","variantIndex":2,"prompt":"五點 P、Q、R、S、T 依序環繞。相鄰兩數的平均依序為 7、10、11、9、7，即 (P+Q)/2＝7，…，(T+P)/2＝7。求 P。","answer":"6","explanation":"交錯相加得 P＝7−10+11−9+7＝6。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x=7-10+11-9+7","root":"6","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"text":"12","misconception":"由相鄰兩數的和消去後，忘記最後除以 2。","id":"c1"},{"text":"7","misconception":"把 P、Q 的平均直接當成 P。","id":"c2"},{"text":"6","id":"c3"},{"text":"14","misconception":"把 T+P 的和當成 P，未扣除 T。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q072-V3","typeId":"鄰邊平均環","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"variantOf":"Q072","variantIndex":3,"prompt":"五點 P、Q、R、S、T 依序環繞。相鄰兩數的平均依序為 8.5、11.5、12、10、8，即 (P+Q)/2＝8.5，…，(T+P)/2＝8。求 P。","answer":"7","explanation":"交錯相加得 P＝8.5−11.5+12−10+8＝7。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x=8.5-11.5+12-10+8","root":"7","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"text":"14","misconception":"由相鄰兩數的和消去後，忘記最後除以 2。","id":"c1"},{"text":"17/2","misconception":"把 P、Q 的平均直接當成 P。","id":"c2"},{"text":"16","misconception":"把 T+P 的和當成 P，未扣除 T。","id":"c3"},{"text":"7","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q072-V4","typeId":"鄰邊平均環","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"variantOf":"Q072","variantIndex":4,"prompt":"五點 P、Q、R、S、T 依序環繞。相鄰兩數的平均依序為 10、13、13、11、9，即 (P+Q)/2＝10，…，(T+P)/2＝9。求 P。","answer":"8","explanation":"交錯相加得 P＝10−13+13−11+9＝8。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x=10-13+13-11+9","root":"8","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"text":"8","id":"c1"},{"text":"16","misconception":"由相鄰兩數的和消去後，忘記最後除以 2。","id":"c2"},{"text":"10","misconception":"把 P、Q 的平均直接當成 P。","id":"c3"},{"text":"18","misconception":"把 T+P 的和當成 P，未扣除 T。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"l